to work effectively with individuals from diverse communities and cultures Requirements Education & Experience: Currently enrolled Stephens College Student Good interpersonal, verbal and written communication skills Good organizational and time management skills Experience in working with a diverse population Salary Description $15.00/hour Apply Stephens College Work Study Jobs Jobs View All Jobs Powered by Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Stephens College Work Study Jobs: Privacy Policy"
