new techniques Dependability and punctuality are essential Physical ability to lift up to 40 lbs and perform manual labor Availability: Must have two-hour slots available during shop hours. This position reports to Lindsey Wigand, Scene Shop Foreman. Salary Description $15.00/hour Apply Stephens College Work Study Jobs Jobs View All Jobs Powered by Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Stephens College Work Study Jobs: Privacy Policy"
