ns process Effective communication and time management skills Comfortable speaking publicly and interacting with individuals and groups Professional appearance and demeanor required Availability: Applicants must be available a minimum of two days per week in any of the following time slots: 10am to 12pm | 1pm to 3pm | 3pm to 5pm This position reports to Kristy Simpson, Director of Recruitment and Retention. Salary Description $15.00/hour Apply Stephens College Work Study Jobs Jobs View All Jobs Powered by Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Stephens College Work Study Jobs: Privacy Policy"
